        1056,
        1281
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "2. This salary adjustment plan which had been provided for employees in the American Museum of Natural History whose wages are fixed in accordance with Section of the Labor Law under the terms and conditions provided by Executive Order No. 83 dated June 14, 1968 is hereby terminated for such employees effective January 1, 1969.",
